    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our free version, you can play up to shop level 10, unlock a set of sushi, access one shop area, and expand your sushi shop\u2019s conveyor belt. This gives you a taste of the core gameplay experience and a glimpse of what\u2019s waiting for you in the full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Conveyor Belt Sushi Simulator&quot; is a cozy first-person simulation where you serve sushi to customers, earn money, and grow your sushi restaurant business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROLOGUE FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/36c72e77da5f2186780a6fd249fe039a.avif?t=1744879680\" data-has-big width=800 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/3abba22af0a2c30b309fa7f727c4a394.poster.avif?t=1744879680\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/3abba22af0a2c30b309fa7f727c4a394.webm?t=1744879680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/3abba22af0a2c30b309fa7f727c4a394.mp4?t=1744879680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sushi and place it on the conveyor belt, allowing customers to pick their favorite sushi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/0b4c261667383094adc6ff50bed474f7.avif?t=1744879680\" data-has-big width=800 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/f3030f0835d78e3576b566f241faafbc.poster.avif?t=1744879680\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/f3030f0835d78e3576b566f241faafbc.webm?t=1744879680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/f3030f0835d78e3576b566f241faafbc.mp4?t=1744879680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order stock from the supplier using your tablet. Seafood prices vary daily based on the day's supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/3a3dd635d44cf47d9dc7864fdc4ec528.avif?t=1744879680\" data-has-big width=800 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/bae36e0dce4f2f3abd1120da94e46a0f.poster.avif?t=1744879680\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/bae36e0dce4f2f3abd1120da94e46a0f.webm?t=1744879680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/bae36e0dce4f2f3abd1120da94e46a0f.mp4?t=1744879680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan the sushi plates to calculate the bill. Make sure you don\u2019t miss any plates, or you\u2019ll receive less money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/00fa2549fa48f706178e48f746f76e72.avif?t=1744879680\" data-has-big width=800 height=67 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/9f340e96b4740844d67c0944e3d73a87.poster.avif?t=1744879680\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/9f340e96b4740844d67c0944e3d73a87.webm?t=1744879680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/9f340e96b4740844d67c0944e3d73a87.mp4?t=1744879680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the table for the next customer and deal with troublesome customers before they cause any trouble.</p>",
